{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國傳媒今日報道，有「國民初戀」之稱的《許願吧，精露》秀智最近購入位於首爾江南三成洞，正在興建中的超級豪宅新盤L'ARBRE 27，雖然尚未能確認秀智購入當中那一個單位，但該新盤入場費至少140億韓圜（約8300萬港元），最貴的頂層樓價為400億韓圜（約2.4億港元）。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T09:22:53.194298+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T08:56:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T14:17:43.256723+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T09:17:51.793807+00:00","content_hash":"a8c0f9f4688b4a5c6943d5e52fc9271a8ae0a8ac4f54fb9218cb6d25852cc08c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}